00:47:32.620 --> 00:47:32.670
That is so thoughtful.

1271
00:47:32.670 --> 00:47:33.280
He's good.

1272
00:47:33.600 --> 00:47:34.360
He's amazing.

1273
00:47:35.120 --> 00:47:37.420
